            "text": "Let M>0 be arbitrary. Choose δ>0 from F001 with H^s_δ(E)>M. Apply N006 at s,δ to obtain H^(s+1)_δ(F)≥H^s_δ(E)>M. Hence H^(s+1)(F)>M. Since M was arbitrary, H^(s+1)(F)=∞. Record this as F002.",
